     [38;5;246mIn-page reminders always; OS notification additionally when the user has opted in and granted permission. [39m
     [38;5;246mPermission requested only on explicit opt-in.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m In-page only
     [38;5;246mReminder UI inside the page. No permissions, no browser APIs, simplest to build and test. User must be looking at [39m
     [38;5;246mthe tab.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m OS notifications only
     [38;5;246mDesktop notifications via the Notification API. Nothing shown in-page, so denied or unsupported permission means no
[39m     [38;5;246mreminders at all.[39m
